@startsalt
' Screen: Flag Capture Modal
' User Stories:
'   - US-508: As a developer, I can flag a run step interaction with a reason and tags
'   - US-509: As a developer, I can redact sensitive attributes before saving a flag
'   - US-510: As a developer, I can add notes to explain the flagging context

{
  <b>Flag This Interaction</b>                                          [✕]
  ==
  {
    <b>Title</b> <i>(required)</i>
    "                                                                    "
    <i>Short, descriptive. e.g. "Hallucinated product name", "Good recovery example"</i>
    --
    <b>Reason</b> <i>(required)</i>
    ^deviation                                                           ^
    <i>Options: deviation / bug / edge_case / good_example / regression</i>
    --
    <b>Tags</b>
    "billing ×" | "refund ×" | "add tag..." |
    <i>Used for filtering and breakdown reports</i>
    --
    <b>Notes</b> <i>(optional)</i>
    {+
      "                                                                    "
      "                                                                    "
      "                                                                    "
    }
    ==
    <b>Redaction Panel</b>
    <i>Select attributes to scrub from the saved capture (irreversible).</i>
    --
    {
      [X] customer.email
      [X] customer.phone
      [ ] order.id
      [ ] agent.prompt
      [ ] llm.model
    }
    <i>Scrubbed values will be replaced with [REDACTED].</i>
    ==
    {
      [Cancel] | [Save Flag]
    }
  }
}
@endsalt
